771
01:53:51.510 --> 01:53:53.510
For the landowner.

772
01:53:53.510 --> 01:53:56.510
And they have borne fruit, contributed.

773
01:53:56.510 --> 01:53:58.510
Earned something.

774
01:53:58.510 --> 01:54:00.510
They have made a difference.

775
01:54:00.510 --> 01:54:02.510
They did not just sit in their chairs.

776
01:54:02.510 --> 01:54:04.510
